'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page two of the [[Chemical Agents Premium Warbond#Page 2|Chemical Agents]] Premium [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|20|notext}} and 5 [[Medal]]s.

==Trivia==
The Division Zero symbol, also used on the casing of the [[G-4 Gas]] grenade, resembles the [[wikipedia:File:WMD-chemical.svg|U.S. Army symbol for chemical weapons]] but with [[The Helldivers|the Helldiver]] skull in its center.

